The description and hashtag layers therefore do different jobs: $\begin{aligned}
D &: \text{turn attention into an action or continued watching}, \\
H &: \text{mark topic relevance and page-niche relevance}.\end{aligned}$ This separation is useful. It keeps us from treating every piece of text around the Reel as if it served the same purpose.

