A concise reconstruction of that closing idea is $\mathrm{brand\ awareness}
\leftarrow
\mathrm{consistent\ publishing\ across\ social\ channels}.$ This is a summary of the strategic direction, not a measured causal formula. The lecture’s practical message is that posting the Reel is an execution step, while the reason for doing it is broader: repeated visibility around the brand.

